      "message": "gerrit_plugin_test_util: make it aware of external dependencies\n\nBring its API surface in line with gerrit_plugin and gerrit_plugin_tests\nwhich both already accept `plugin` and `ext_deps`. Without these,\ncallers have had to hardcode raw @\u003cplugin\u003e_plugin_deps//:\u003cartifact\u003e\nBazel labels in `deps`.\n\nAdd three optional parameters:\n\n* `plugin`: when set, prepend `:\u003cplugin\u003e__plugin` to `deps` and\n  derive the default `ext_repo`. Matches gerrit_plugin_tests.\n* `ext_deps`: Maven coordinates resolved via _artifacts() and\n  appended to `deps`. Matches gerrit_plugin.\n* `ext_repo`: rules_jvm_external repository name. Defaults to\n  `\u003cplugin\u003e_plugin_deps`.\n\nAll three default to None/[], so existing callers are unaffected.\next_deps without plugin or ext_repo fails loudly rather than\nsilently emitting unresolvable labels.\n\nChange-Id: I450b75af92f64ae8c749b37c6d690d60930105ab",
